              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "RONSAXPA"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have been looking for a recipe like this for years. It is like the old German farmers around here used to make. My only change was to process the meats, onions and spices very fine in the food processor. It turned out a lot like braunsweiger. Which isn't bad. Excellent."
